  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BA5-QA2-101" ;
  triage:title "retry backoff on the queue re-arm path has no jitter (REJECTED by design ruling, no fix)" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-2 (rust-service-hardening-agent), PR #1407 @ 7997f8aaa. Retry backoff on the queue re-arm path has no jitter. fenix's ruling (PR #1407, issuecomment-5643452062): REJECTED -- the design specifies a fixed re-arm interval with attempt back-off; jitter is not in the contract and adding it would be unrequested behaviour. Not carried to BA.6. No fix scheduled, no dispatch. Record this as correlated evidence only; the finding is closed by team-lead ruling, not by a code fix." ;
